WEBVTT

01:01.560 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>Students and Master</b></i>

01:09.980 --> 01:14.860
Vietnam, Northwestern Hanoi

01:33.630 --> 01:35.010
<b>Blade...</b>

01:35.010 --> 01:40.550
<b>Each stroke of your sword
makes my heart beat faster...</b>

01:41.430 --> 01:42.970
<b>Kikyo...</b>

01:42.970 --> 01:47.560
<b>I'm gonna put an end to that screwed
up dedication to fighting of yours.</b>

01:49.480 --> 01:53.820
<b>Then try and take my life,
if you can.</b>

02:10.670 --> 02:14.790
THE
FIRST
BLADE

02:11.820 --> 02:14.790
SAVAGE
MOON

02:20.340 --> 02:25.230
<b><i>Yagyuu Estate, Nara</i></b>

02:55.050 --> 02:55.840
<b>I give up!</b>

03:03.390 --> 03:05.890
<b>I hereby declare that spar a draw.</b>

03:09.020 --> 03:11.290
<b>Why, master?</b>

03:12.190 --> 03:13.790
<b>Can you not tell?</b>

03:14.320 --> 03:17.300
<b>Master, please explain.</b>

03:19.780 --> 03:21.360
<b>Eric...</b>

03:21.360 --> 03:26.080
<b>Allowing yourself to accept defeat in
battle is akin to committing suicide.</b>

03:26.080 --> 03:26.830
<b>Sir.</b>

03:27.490 --> 03:29.000
<b>Kikyo...</b>

03:29.000 --> 03:33.000
<b>The true path of the sword
is not to simply pursue victory.</b>

03:34.000 --> 03:35.420
<b>Listen, both of you.</b>

03:35.420 --> 03:39.090
<b>You must strengthen your hearts.</b>

03:39.090 --> 03:41.130
<b>You must always consider
the nature of the sword,</b>

03:41.130 --> 03:44.550
<b>and through that you will know
the meaning of true battle.</b>

03:45.550 --> 03:46.640
<b>Understood?</b>

03:46.640 --> 03:47.700
<b>Sir!</b>

03:48.260 --> 03:49.950
<b>Understood.</b>

03:52.100 --> 03:55.480
<b>It was a splendid display,
both of you.</b>

04:15.160 --> 04:17.720
THE
SECOND
BLADE

04:15.860 --> 04:17.720
PHANTOM
MOON

04:29.270 --> 04:30.790
<b>I'm not through yet!</b>

04:31.390 --> 04:33.350
<b>That's the spirit!</b>

04:33.350 --> 04:34.100
<b>Come on!</b>

04:38.570 --> 04:40.070
<b>Eric...</b>

04:40.070 --> 04:42.420
<b>How long have you been here?</b>

04:42.780 --> 04:44.610
<b>Two years, sir.</b>

04:44.610 --> 04:49.620
<b>And I assume once your training is complete,
you will return to Mr. Helsing?</b>

04:50.450 --> 04:51.370
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

04:51.450 --> 04:54.290
<b>To be completely honest,
I consider it a waste.</b>

04:54.290 --> 04:59.090
<b>I would have liked to see you perfect
the path of the swordsman, at my side.</b>

05:00.210 --> 05:02.800
<b>I am truly honored, sir.</b>

05:02.800 --> 05:04.470
<b>But I...</b>

05:05.260 --> 05:06.970
<b>No, my apologies.</b>

05:06.970 --> 05:12.100
<b>Every person has a destiny
that he must face.</b>

05:13.060 --> 05:16.730
<b>And no one has the right
to cast aspersions on that fate.</b>

05:19.400 --> 05:21.780
<b>Stand, you two.</b>

05:21.780 --> 05:23.210
<b>It's time for a lesson.</b>

05:28.570 --> 05:33.950
<b>I will now teach you two of
the three Yagyuu hidden techniques.</b>

05:34.740 --> 05:35.980
<b>Hidden techniques?</b>

05:35.980 --> 05:40.960
<b>You must master the first blade and
the second blade for yourselves.</b>

05:40.960 --> 05:43.960
<b>Once you've perfected these,</b>

05:44.590 --> 05:47.740
<b>and if you understand
the true nature of the sword,</b>

05:47.740 --> 05:47.740
<b>then you will naturally come to
master the third hidden technique.</b>

05:52.260 --> 05:53.970
<b>Keep this in mind as you face me.</b>

05:55.060 --> 05:58.230
<b>Now, the first blade, Savage Moon...</b>

06:09.110 --> 06:10.370
<b>I appreciate everything you've done.</b>

06:11.030 --> 06:13.950
<b>You did well to grow this much.</b>

06:13.950 --> 06:17.410
<b>I am happy to have met you.</b>

06:18.080 --> 06:19.380
<b>Wait, Eric.</b>

06:21.170 --> 06:25.590
<b>Before you leave, I want to
know which of us is stronger.</b>

06:26.170 --> 06:28.050
<b>Kikyo, cease this!</b>

06:28.880 --> 06:30.930
<b>No, master.</b>

06:30.930 --> 06:36.430
<b>I, Kikyo, consider the path of the sword
to be the foundation of my very being.</b>

06:36.430 --> 06:38.480
<b>Please, allow me this indulgence.</b>

06:40.520 --> 06:42.040
<b>Very well...</b>

06:45.550 --> 06:50.200
<b>Eric, I must become
the strongest of all.</b>

06:51.240 --> 06:54.330
<b>If I am not, then I fail
to see the point in living.</b>

06:54.330 --> 06:56.500
<b>Now, defend yourself!</b>

07:00.790 --> 07:02.000
<b>This is a waste of time.</b>

07:02.710 --> 07:05.590
<b>I have no intention of fighting.</b>

07:05.590 --> 07:07.420
<b>Damn you...</b>

07:07.420 --> 07:09.340
<b>are you mocking me!?</b>

07:23.940 --> 07:25.730
<b>The fight is over.</b>

07:27.070 --> 07:28.400
<b>Kill me, Eric.</b>

07:29.570 --> 07:31.240
<b>Cut my head off.</b>

07:32.870 --> 07:37.870
<b>If you keep being obsessed with how strong
you are, you won't have much of a future.</b>

07:44.080 --> 07:46.750
<b>Eric, take care of yourself.</b>

07:47.630 --> 07:48.920
<b>Thank you, sir.</b>

07:52.610 --> 07:53.890
<b>Goodbye, Kikyo.</b>

08:04.520 --> 08:08.900
<b>That was the only time
I've ever suffered defeat.</b>

08:09.490 --> 08:13.070
<b>To clear that shame,
I must strike you down.</b>

08:21.000 --> 08:23.830
<b>Kikyo, is that one of yours?</b>

08:24.880 --> 08:27.520
<b>What is this murderous intent?</b>

08:36.410 --> 08:38.720
<b>Who did you think it was, Eric?</b>

08:39.470 --> 08:40.180
<b>Master!</b>

08:41.020 --> 08:42.660
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

08:44.770 --> 08:47.360
<b>What's wrong, Eric?</b>

08:47.360 --> 08:49.480
<b>Come to me.</b>

08:49.480 --> 08:54.320
<b>Let me see my favorite student's
face up close after all this time.</b>

08:55.570 --> 08:57.180
<b>It can't be...</b>

08:58.830 --> 09:01.250
<b>I suppose I can't hide it!</b>

09:01.700 --> 09:03.250
<b>Impossible...</b>

09:03.250 --> 09:04.710
<b>why?</b>

09:04.710 --> 09:07.130
<b>You were heralded as
a sword saint, so why!?</b>

09:07.960 --> 09:11.090
<b>Eric, I've been wanting
to see you again.</b>

09:12.050 --> 09:16.970
<b>After you left the dojo, I was struck with a
respiratory illness that left me crippled.</b>

09:16.970 --> 09:24.600
<b>Disease ravaged my body, and before long,
I could sense my impending death.</b>

09:26.770 --> 09:31.980
<b>Kikyo...</b>

09:28.540 --> 09:32.090
<b>I have nothing else
to teach you.</b>

09:32.400 --> 09:34.820
<b>I am closing this dojo.</b>

09:35.740 --> 09:38.870
<b>Take your belongings,
and leave immediately.</b>

09:39.240 --> 09:41.490
<b>Master, I can't...</b>

09:41.490 --> 09:42.450
<b>Kikyo...</b>

09:43.790 --> 09:48.710
<b>The difference between you and Eric is
your ignorance of the outside world.</b>

09:48.710 --> 09:54.340
<b>If you seek greater heights as a swordsman, then
you must go on a journey, and gain experience.</b>

09:55.010 --> 09:59.090
<b>Learn how people live,
and learn how you must live.</b>

10:00.010 --> 10:01.720
<b>Now, go.</b>

10:03.560 --> 10:05.140
<b>Master...</b>

10:05.140 --> 10:13.150
<b>I will never forget the gratitude I owe you for taking
me in, when I had no family and no memory.</b>

10:14.070 --> 10:17.990
<b>Do not neglect your practice.</b>

10:18.380 --> 10:19.200
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

10:20.030 --> 10:21.370
<b>It's been an honor.</b>

10:43.930 --> 10:45.040
<b>But...</b>

10:45.060 --> 10:47.430
<b>In the end, I was a warrior.</b>

10:47.430 --> 10:53.070
<b>I wanted to continue to wield my sword,
until the very end.</b>

10:53.690 --> 10:58.050
To
Master
Yagyuu
Tanba

10:54.690 --> 10:58.050
<b>It was around then that
I received a message.</b>

10:58.240 --> 11:02.450
<b>It was a request to kill
a certain vampire.</b>

11:02.780 --> 11:08.290
<b>I had traveled with Helsing in my youth,
and acted as a hunter myself...</b>

11:08.790 --> 11:16.630
<b>I took my silver edged blade to my side, and sought
to live as a swordsman for the remainder of my life.</b>

11:17.550 --> 11:20.300
<b>I had no idea that my target, Eric,</b>

11:20.300 --> 11:27.180
<b>was the vampire that you had
sworn your vendetta against...</b>

11:46.700 --> 11:49.500
<b>It's a pleasure to see you,
Yagyuu Tanba.</b>

11:56.920 --> 11:58.170
<b>It can't be...</b>

11:58.170 --> 11:59.380
<b>the request...</b>

11:59.380 --> 12:01.630
<b>it was a trap!?</b>

12:02.180 --> 12:03.300
<b>Clearly.</b>

12:03.930 --> 12:08.680
<b>I knew you were Blade's master...</b>

12:08.680 --> 12:12.690
<b>and now I will make you
into a member of Existence.</b>

12:28.660 --> 12:29.830
<b>Curse you...</b>

12:29.830 --> 12:33.080
<b>I cannot believe I made
such a grave mistake...</b>

12:36.670 --> 12:40.260
<b>but I will not become
a pawn for you!</b>

12:42.470 --> 12:44.630
<b>Don't be foolish.</b>

12:45.590 --> 12:50.180
<b>I can see the regret deep within you.</b>

12:51.270 --> 12:52.480
<b>What!?</b>

12:52.930 --> 12:56.100
<b>You'd like to fight Blade before you die,
wouldn't you!?</b>

12:57.230 --> 12:59.150
<b>How dare you!?</b>

12:59.150 --> 13:05.610
<b>I would only direct my sword at my students
if they brought shame upon their teachings!</b>

13:06.030 --> 13:09.200
<b>I can tell how you really feel...</b>

13:09.200 --> 13:13.330
<b>Because we're both men who have sought
greater and greater heights,</b>

13:13.330 --> 13:16.420
<b>and the security of our power.</b>

13:17.170 --> 13:21.090
<b>I will not waste another moment of
my time listening to your prattle!</b>

13:21.630 --> 13:23.340
<b>Kill me!</b>

13:23.340 --> 13:24.880
<b>Yagyuu Tanba...</b>

13:24.880 --> 13:28.390
<b>allow me to grant you your wish.</b>

13:35.390 --> 13:37.060
<b>God damn you, Frost...</b>

13:37.060 --> 13:38.860
<b>Unbelievable...</b>

13:41.270 --> 13:42.440
<b>Eric!</b>

13:42.780 --> 13:43.990
<b>Face me!</b>

13:44.650 --> 13:45.780
<b>Master!</b>

13:48.280 --> 13:49.240
<b>Now!</b>

13:50.080 --> 13:53.870
<b>I should have stayed
with him at the dojo,</b>

13:53.870 --> 13:55.540
<b>despite his protests.</b>

13:56.460 --> 13:58.500
<b>Is this fate?</b>

14:00.290 --> 14:05.260
<b>In that case, I will make up for my
past mistakes with my sword.</b>

14:05.260 --> 14:06.760
<b>My duty is to kill you!</b>

14:08.470 --> 14:10.430
<b>Prepare yourself, master!</b>

14:12.890 --> 14:14.430
<b>Stand aside, Kikyo!</b>

14:16.890 --> 14:18.400
<b>Insolent fool.</b>

14:18.400 --> 14:20.060
<b>This is no place for you.</b>

14:20.560 --> 14:24.230
<b>I'll cut that head of yours off!</b>

14:26.990 --> 14:28.360
<b>Eric!</b>

14:28.360 --> 14:30.800
<b>So, you're finally ready?</b>

14:34.740 --> 14:36.580
<b>Come now, Eric!</b>

14:36.580 --> 14:38.730
<b>I've been waiting for this!</b>

14:46.800 --> 14:54.100
<b>Have a taste of this body, free of
disease, and surging with power!</b>

15:13.450 --> 15:14.660
<b>I...</b>

15:14.660 --> 15:16.040
<b>am all messed up.</b>

15:17.620 --> 15:21.790
<b>I ended up making him worry,
because I couldn't cut it...</b>

15:27.010 --> 15:29.170
<b>Why's there a helicopter out here?</b>

15:31.640 --> 15:33.220
<b>Razor, we've gotta go back!</b>

15:39.230 --> 15:42.900
<b>Entertain me more, Eric!</b>

15:43.400 --> 15:46.110
<b>You've been twisted by vampire blood...</b>

15:46.110 --> 15:49.690
<b>master, I will kill you!</b>

15:49.690 --> 15:51.150
<b>Well said.</b>

16:09.420 --> 16:11.240
<b>What's the matter, Eric!?</b>

16:11.240 --> 16:14.300
<b>We're not nearly done yet!</b>

16:18.680 --> 16:21.890
<b>I had no idea that a sword possessed
by darkness could be this strong!</b>

16:24.650 --> 16:26.980
<b>The first blade, Savage Moon.</b>

16:26.980 --> 16:28.650
<b>The second blade, Phantom Moon.</b>

16:28.650 --> 16:30.420
<b>You did well to withstand them...</b>

16:30.690 --> 16:32.820
<b>But what about this!?</b>

16:36.450 --> 16:37.740
<b>That stance...</b>

17:01.540 --> 17:05.370
THE
THIRD
BLADE

17:02.230 --> 17:05.370
CHAOTIC
MOON

17:05.980 --> 17:09.320
<b>So, how does the third blade feel?</b>

17:10.980 --> 17:14.700
<b>Eric, I'm disappointed in you.</b>

17:14.700 --> 17:17.240
<b>Is this all your sword can manage?</b>

17:43.380 --> 17:46.060
THE
THIRD
BLADE

17:44.470 --> 17:46.060
CHAOTIC
MOON

17:54.150 --> 17:55.760
<b>Well done...</b>

17:56.490 --> 18:04.500
<b>You've now mastered the ultimate technique,
the third blade, Chaotic Moon...</b>

18:05.250 --> 18:06.080
<b>Master!</b>

18:07.370 --> 18:09.420
<b>Listen, Eric...</b>

18:09.420 --> 18:10.630
<b>Mind my words.</b>

18:11.460 --> 18:17.680
<b>When you gaze into an abyss,
the abyss also gazes into you.</b>

18:18.970 --> 18:19.930
<b>Master...</b>

18:21.180 --> 18:26.600
<b>But now, you have the power
to defeat that darkness.</b>

18:31.690 --> 18:35.690
<b>Having been cut down by you,
and regaining my humanity...</b>

18:35.690 --> 18:41.620
<b>I, Yagyuu Tanba, can now say that having trained
the two of you is my greatest source of pride.</b>

18:42.160 --> 18:45.660
<b>Goodbye, my two favorite students!</b>

19:08.730 --> 19:11.230
<b>It's been a while, Blade.</b>

19:11.810 --> 19:14.400
<b>How did you enjoy seeing
your master again?</b>

19:14.820 --> 19:16.730
<b>Frost, you motherfucker!</b>

19:17.610 --> 19:21.110
<b>Human lifespans are pretty inconvenient,
don't you think?</b>

19:21.110 --> 19:26.790
<b>If Yagyuu Tanba had still been healthy,
he'd have never fallen into my trap.</b>

19:27.160 --> 19:28.500
<b>Shut your mouth!</b>

19:28.500 --> 19:32.460
<b>You've killed your master,
and become that much stronger.</b>

19:33.210 --> 19:34.250
<b>Now, get angry!</b>

19:34.460 --> 19:37.340
<b>Let your blood boil
with your hate for me!</b>

19:37.340 --> 19:40.680
<b>Fight me with your full strength!</b>

19:57.480 --> 19:59.280
<b>Load him into the helicopter.</b>

20:01.740 --> 20:03.570
<b>Wait, Frost.</b>

20:04.870 --> 20:06.140
<b>Kikyo?</b>

20:06.450 --> 20:08.870
<b>Your contract's complete.</b>

20:12.460 --> 20:13.400
<b>That's...!</b>

20:13.880 --> 20:14.900
<b>It can't be!</b>

20:20.670 --> 20:21.630
<b>Dammit!</b>

20:25.510 --> 20:27.470
<b>Are you a friend of Blade's?</b>

20:28.060 --> 20:28.910
<b>And you are?</b>

20:29.520 --> 20:32.810
<b>I was a mercenary
who worked for them.</b>

20:34.100 --> 20:36.060
<b>...but I was just relieved of my duty.</b>

20:36.610 --> 20:39.420
<b>Where'd they take him!?</b>

20:39.730 --> 20:43.990
<b>They're probably headed
to their laboratory in Cambodia.</b>

20:44.490 --> 20:46.620
<b>I don't know much more than that.</b>

20:46.620 --> 20:49.870
<b>Alright, let's go to Cambodia.</b>

20:49.870 --> 20:50.620
<b>Wait.</b>

20:51.200 --> 20:53.040
<b>What can you accomplish by yourself?</b>

20:55.920 --> 20:57.690
<b>I made a promise...</b>

20:58.120 --> 20:59.770
<b>to give this back to him.</b>

21:09.430 --> 21:10.950
<b>Master...</b>

21:12.680 --> 21:14.100
<b>Deacon Frost...</b>

21:14.730 --> 21:15.900
<b>I will not abide this.</b>

21:16.810 --> 21:17.980
<b>Wait for me!</b>

21:17.980 --> 21:20.820
<b><i>I don't care where you go,
I'll bring it to you!</i></b>

23:03.630 --> 23:08.880
<b>Didn't Dad say that we should eat together
as much as possible, since Mom died?</b>

23:11.640 --> 23:15.010
<b>Even so, I want to become
a scholar like Dad...</b>

23:15.680 --> 23:18.430
<b>and help with his research.</b>

23:18.430 --> 23:20.770
<b>You god damn vampires...</b>

23:21.060 --> 23:25.530
<b>I'll kill every last one of you!</b>

23:26.150 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>Maelstrom of Lament</b></i>

23:27.030 --> 23:30.610
<b>Next time on Blade: Maelstrom of Lament.</b>
